  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>롄<ruby>훼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby>컹<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>혱<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>신<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>땸<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>애</span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g4mQmLZ-lEw?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>个<rt>에ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>代<rt>대</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>誌<rt>지</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’둏에 <ruby>形影<rt>혱얄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yu-kôh-si-hît-é, bo-tai bo-ji siṵ̄’tioh-e hieng-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>一陣<rt>짇준-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>吹<rt>췌ˆ</rt></ruby>’롷래, <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>春風<rt>춘ˉ헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-chiṵ-jit-jun-hông, chuê’loh-lai, si-chūn-hōng-siàu-lién\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>坐<rt>제ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>坐<rt>제-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>牢<rt>ᄃᆤˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>真<rt>진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>聊<rt>ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jē ma-si-sū-liām, je-boe-tiáu, jīn-bo-liáu’e sū-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>倒<rt>도ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>眠床<rt>삔층-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>頂<rt>뎽ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>月娘<rt>뀋뉴ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>笑<rt>쵸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>規个<rt>귀ˉ에-</rt></ruby><ruby>暗暝<rt>암ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tò-lêh-bin-chng-tièng, hor-gueh-niú, chiò-kūi-e-àm-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>世界<rt>세ˋ개</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà kia̰-kuè-lì’e sè-kai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby>애\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ̰-mîh goà lông-bo-ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> (<ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-siṵ-bêh-ti-lî-sīm-lāi (siâ-jit-tiau-koâ)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>車<rt>챠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>인<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>期待<rt>기태ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiâ kia̰-kuè-īn’e ki-thāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>站<rt>잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>落來<rt>롷래ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jît-jām kôh-bo-loh-lái\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>對<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>샹<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>交代<rt>ᄀᅷˉ대ˉ</rt></ruby> (<ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>驚驚<rt>걀ˉ걀ˆ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-siṵ-bêh-tùi-siáng kāu-tāi (sīm-lāi kiā̰-kiâ̰)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想起<rt>슐키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>暗<rt>암</rt></ruby> <ruby>小可仔<rt>쇼ˆ콰ˆ아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歹勢<rt>패ˆ세</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-khî-goà hît-am siô-khoâ-â-phâi-se\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>揣<rt>췌ˉ</rt></ruby>’둏꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hor-lì chuē’tioh-goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>規<rt>귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>身軀<rt>신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>藏<rt>창ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>好勢<rt>호ˆ세</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>委屈<rt>위ˆ쿧</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kūi-sīn-khû chàng-bo-hô-se’e wî-khut\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>風中<rt>헝ˉ뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>飛龍<rt>붸ˉ롕ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>吼<rt>ᄒᅷˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hōng-tiông’e puē-liéng lêh-hàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>聲聲<rt>샬ˉ샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>天搖地動<rt>틸ˉ요데당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siā̰-siâ̰ hor-thḭ̄-yo-te-tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>傳說<rt>돤솯</rt></ruby> <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>頂懸<rt>뎽ˆ괠ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ài-lì’e toan-soat siâ-ti-tiêng-koá̰i\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>紲<rt>솨</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>飛<rt>붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愈<rt>뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>懸<rt>괠ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-jiéng soa’lai rû-puē-rû-koá̰i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>開<rt>퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>蹛<rt>돠</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>樓<rt>ᄅᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huê, khūi-ti-lî-toa’e láu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>當時<rt>덩ˉ시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>綴<rt>뒈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>走<rt>ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ̄, tōng-sí bêh-tuè-lî-jàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>多情<rt>도ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>雨<rt>허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>崁<rt>캄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>目睭<rt>빡쥬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tō-jiéng’e hōr khàm-tioh-bak-jiû\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>代誌<rt>대지</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>清楚<rt>촁ˉ초ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e tai-ji kông-boe-chiēng-chò\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤</rt></ruby> <ruby>千山萬水<rt>쳰ˉ산ˉ빤쉬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-lì kia̰-kue chiēn-sān-ban-sùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>手內<rt>츄ˆ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>薔薇<rt>쳥삐ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>微微<rt>삐삐-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>芳<rt>팡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiû-lāi chiong-bí bi-bi-â-phâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>行踏<rt>걀닿-</rt></ruby><ruby>輕鬆<rt>킨ˉ상ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>跤步<rt>카ˉ버ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kia̰-tah-khīn-sāng-khā-pōr’e goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>쟈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>出聲<rt>춛ˆ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tiam-tiam-ti-jiâ lông-bo-chût-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>日子<rt>띧즤ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rit-jì kuè-jit-kâng kôh-jit-kâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>猶未<rt>얗ˆ쀄-</rt></ruby><ruby>放<rt>방</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e ît-che lông-yâh-bue-pang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>斡頭<rt>왇ˆᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>揣<rt>췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oât-tháu bêh-chue-kuè-khi’e goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>煞<rt>쇃</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    soah’lai boe-kì-kā-kī’e miá\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>陪<rt>붸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>流浪<rt>류렁ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-goà bêh-pue-lì liu-lōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>長<rt>등-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>終點<rt>졍ˉ댬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>滿<rt>뫄ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>花雨<rt>훼ˉ우ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tng-lōr jiōng-tiàm moâ-thḭ̂ huē-ù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>茫霧<rt>뻥뿌ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>內底<rt>래되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>慐<rt>껑-</rt></ruby><ruby>神<rt>신ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bong-bū lai-toè gong-sín\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>千年<rt>촁ˉ니ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>流轉<rt>류좐ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>世界<rt>세ˋ개</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiēng-ní liu-joân-lì’e sè-kai\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>自作多情<rt>주적ˆ도ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ju-jôrk-tō-jiéng’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>眼前<rt>깐ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>地獄<rt>데꼑ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>揀<rt>곙ˋ</rt></ruby>’에\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gân-jiéng te-giêk kā-kī kièng’e\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>天上<rt>톈ˉ셩ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>地下<rt>데하ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>人間<rt>띤간ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thiēn-siōng, te-hā, rin-kân\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>四方<rt>수ˋ헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>妖孽<rt>ᄋᆤˉ꼗ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>請<rt>챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>退下<rt>테ˋ하ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sù-hōng-yāu-giêt chiâ̰-lìn thè-hā\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>繁華<rt>환화-</rt></ruby><ruby>世間<rt>세ˋ간ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jê-hoan-hoa-sè-kân\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>眾生<rt>졍ˋ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>情<rt>졩-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiòng-siêng u-jieng-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>生<rt>셀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煩惱<rt>환로ˋ</rt></ruby> (<ruby>甘願<rt>감ˉ꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>受罪<rt>슈줴ˉ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-jiéng sḛ̄-hoan-lò (kām-goan-siu-juē)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心狂<rt>심ˉ겅ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>火著<rt>훼ˆ돟ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-kóng kôh-huê-tôh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>明知<rt>뼹재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>艱苦<rt>간ˉ커ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bieng-jāi-e-kān-khòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>千錯萬錯<rt>쳰ˉ초ˋ빤초</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>關<rt>관ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiēn-chò-ban-cho lông-kâh-lì bo-koân\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n"
}
